Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:16:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] winemapi: Simple MAPI mailbox for
 SaveMail/FindNext/ReadMail/DeleteMail (3242)

The provider keeps the messages saved with MAPISaveMail in the process
(identifiers are only valid for the session, as the documentation says):
MAPIFindNext walks them by message type from a seed (MAPI_UNREAD_ONLY),
MAPIReadMail returns a MapiMessage freeable with one MAPIFreeBuffer
(MAPI_ENVELOPE_ONLY, MAPI_SUPPRESS_ATTACH, MAPI_BODY_AS_FILE, MAPI_PEEK,
attachments copied to temporary files), MAPIDeleteMail removes. Error codes
follow the documented tables (invalid session / message, no messages).
The declaration of MAPIReadMail's last parameter is now lpMapiMessage*.

